$fieldc2 = stripslashes('<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"><strong>PROMETHEUS USER MANUAL</strong></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</div>

<div style=\"text-align: center\"></div>

<div style=\"text-align: center\"></div>

<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>! WORK IN PROGRESS !</strong><br />
<span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"></span></span><br />
<span style=\"font-size: medium\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"></span></span></div>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\"></span></p>

<p data-end=\"649\" data-start=\"83\">Before anything else, you must make sure you are registered with Air Inter <strong data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"158\">BEFORE</strong> signing up on Prométhée. To do this, first register via the \"<strong>Become a Member</strong>\" section on the left of the site, then go to the \"<strong>Registration</strong>\" tab in the \"<strong>The Airline</strong>\" menu of the site and fill out the registration form after reading the MANEX and MANOPS. After your registration is confirmed, you can then register on Prométhée.<br data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"496\" />
Registration on Prométhée <strong data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"525\">DOES NOT REPLACE</strong> the prior and mandatory registration on Air Inter Virtual Airlines; it only grants access to Prométhée.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"651\">1-REGISTRATION</p>

<p data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"669\">2-USAGE</p>

<p data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"680\">3-FINANCE SETTINGS</p>

<p data-end=\"726\" data-start=\"702\">4-FSPASSENGERS &amp; ACARS</p>

<p data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"728\">5-WHY PROMÉTHÉE</p>

<p data-end=\"764\" data-start=\"748\">1-REGISTRATION<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"766\"><strong>a) Main page <strong data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"779\">BEFORE</strong> registration:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"807\">There are 4 tabs at the top of the page:</p>

<p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"851\"><strong>I) Home</strong><br data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"858\" />
To return to Prométhée’s main page (introduction).</p>

<p data-end=\"1057\" data-start=\"915\"><strong>II) Login</strong><br data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"924\" />
To reconnect if you regularly clear your cookies. Normally Prométhée will recognize you on each visit unless you click \"logout.\"</p>

<p data-end=\"1572\" data-start=\"1059\"><strong>III) Registration</strong><br data-end=\"1079\" data-start=\"1076\" />
By clicking this tab, you can submit your registration request on Prométhée. You will receive a registration confirmation, and once logged in (see above), this tab will no longer appear (except after clearing cookies).<br data-end=\"1300\" data-start=\"1297\" />
Company and Hub selection: Only the options provided (AIR INTER and LFPO) are available.<br data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1388\" />
We recommend using the same password as for the site’s \"Members\" section to avoid complications. You can modify your password anytime in your member area (see \"Operations\" below).</p>

<p data-end=\"1723\" data-start=\"1574\"><strong>IV) Active flights map</strong><br data-end=\"1599\" data-start=\"1596\" />
Once operational, you can see flights in progress in real time on a world map (Google Map?) along with associated details.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"1764\" data-start=\"1726\"><strong>b) Main page <strong data-end=\"1748\" data-start=\"1739\">AFTER</strong> registration:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"1808\" data-start=\"1766\">After registering, there will be 6 tabs:</p>

<p data-end=\"1858\" data-start=\"1810\"><strong>I) Home:</strong><br data-end=\"1821\" data-start=\"1818\" />
To return to Prométhée’s main page.</p>

<p data-end=\"2058\" data-start=\"1860\"><strong>II) Operations:</strong><br data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1875\" />
The operations center. Here you can submit your flight reports (PIREPS), view VA finances, your bank account, available flights with reservations and preparations, etc. (see §3).</p>

<p data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2060\"><strong>III) Pilots:</strong><br data-end=\"2075\" data-start=\"2072\" />
Clicking this tab will show the list of registered pilots and various information about them.</p>

<p data-end=\"2285\" data-start=\"2172\"><strong>IV) Timetable:</strong><br data-end=\"2189\" data-start=\"2186\" />
To view schedules. You have access to all 686 flights published in Air Inter Timetable No. 68.</p>

<p data-end=\"2412\" data-start=\"2287\"><strong>V) Active flights map:</strong><br data-end=\"2312\" data-start=\"2309\" />
To see ongoing flights in real time on a world map with details. Only shows pilots using vmsACARS!</p>

<p data-end=\"2598\" data-start=\"2414\"><strong>VI) Logout:</strong><br data-end=\"2428\" data-start=\"2425\" />
Allows you to log out of Prométhée. Clicking \"logout\" is not necessary to leave Prométhée. Note that if you do click \"logout,\" you will need to log in again (see §1-b).</p>

<p data-end=\"2657\" data-start=\"2600\">On the right of the homepage, you will find 3 sections:</p>

<p></p>

<p></p>

