<p data-end=\"5173\" data-start=\"5153\"><strong>3-FINANCE SETTINGS</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"5205\" data-start=\"5175\"><strong>a) Finance settings details:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"5426\" data-start=\"5207\">All parameters below are based on real average data in France and/or average real data from a very large French airline, as of February 2010. An update will be made as soon as the new version of Prométhée is in place.</p>

<p data-end=\"5445\" data-start=\"5428\"><strong>b) Load factor:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"5719\" data-start=\"5447\">80% (real Air Inter average) of each aircraft’s capacity ±10%, i.e., 70–90% occupancy randomly assigned by Prométhée.<br data-end=\"5567\" data-start=\"5564\" />
To make the simulation more realistic and precise (fuel consumption, performance, etc.), we recommend setting aircraft to an average of 80% occupancy.</p>

<p data-end=\"5739\" data-start=\"5721\"><strong>c) Ticket price:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"6221\" data-start=\"5741\">Total flight duration of all published flights divided by number of flights = average 01h05 per flight.<br data-end=\"5847\" data-start=\"5844\" />
Total passenger capacity of all fleet aircraft divided by number of aircraft = average 168 passengers per aircraft.<br data-end=\"5965\" data-start=\"5962\" />
Rates of 7 typical Air Inter economy flights, normal dates and current rates converted to hourly flight = average €106 per flight hour.<br data-end=\"6103\" data-start=\"6100\" />
Ticket price: (106 x 1.1)/65 = <strong>€1.76666 per flight minute</strong><br data-end=\"6163\" data-start=\"6160\" />
Average €114.83 per flight – or €12,291.40 per aircraft.</p>

<p data-end=\"6329\" data-start=\"6223\">Prométhée uses the flight time in the published timetable multiplied by 1.76666 to get the ticket price.</p>

<p data-end=\"6347\" data-start=\"6331\">d) Fuel rates:</p>

<p data-end=\"6510\" data-start=\"6349\">Price ranges from €0.88/l to €1.44/l for JetA1 (other fuel types cannot be integrated into Prométhée).<br data-end=\"6454\" data-start=\"6451\" />
Average JetA1 weight at standard temperature: 840 g/l.</p>

<p></p>

<p></p>

<p></p>

<p></p>

<p></p>

<ul>
	<li data-end=\"6579\" data-start=\"6513\"><strong>€0.88/l</strong> at smaller French airfields used by Air Inter → <strong>€0.74/kg</strong></li>
	<li data-end=\"6639\" data-start=\"6582\"><strong>€1.60/l</strong> at distant/poorly supplied airports →<strong> €1.344/kg</strong></li>
	<li data-end=\"6702\" data-start=\"6642\"><strong>€1.17/l</strong> at Paris-Orly (Air Inter special rate) → <strong>€0.983/kg</strong></li>
</ul>

<p></p>

<p data-end=\"6853\" data-start=\"6704\">Fuel cost for the flight is currently calculated based on departure airport rate; no need to load extra fuel for a round trip to avoid extra costs.</p>

<p data-end=\"6965\" data-start=\"6855\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">A JetA1 rates list is at the bottom of the page.</span> Assistance updating this list would be greatly appreciated.</p>

<p data-end=\"6987\" data-start=\"6967\"><strong>e) Pilot salaries:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"7160\" data-start=\"6989\">Salary based on:<br data-end=\"7008\" data-start=\"7005\" />
Career start: €77,940 gross/year → €6,495 gross/month → <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">€5,000 net/month.</span><br data-end=\"7084\" data-start=\"7081\" />
Career end: €233,820 gross/year → €19,485 gross/month → <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">€15,000 net/month.</span></p>

