	<li data-end=\"7298\" data-start=\"7247\">2nd Period: €10,000 net/month based on 70 flight hours/month&nbsp;→ <strong>€142.86 net/hour.</strong></li>
	<li data-end=\"7352\" data-start=\"7301\">3rd Period: €15,000 net/month based on 70 flight hours/month&nbsp;→ <strong>€214.28 net/hour</strong>.</li>
	<li data-end=\"7380\" data-start=\"7355\">ICS/ACS: To be defined.</li>
</ul>

<p></p>

<p data-end=\"7408\" data-start=\"7382\"><strong>f) Flight crew salaries:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"7640\" data-start=\"7410\">Salary based on €70,140 gross/year → €5,845 gross/month → €4,500 net/month.<br data-end=\"7488\" data-start=\"7485\" />
Average over a career (start to end) for:<br data-end=\"7532\" data-start=\"7529\" />
Flight crew: Co-pilot + flight engineer (if applicable)<br data-end=\"7590\" data-start=\"7587\" />
Cabin crew: Senior stewards + stewards/hostesses</p>

<p data-end=\"7816\" data-start=\"7642\">Average for a crew of 7 per aircraft → €584.50/h flight @ €83.50 gross/hour based on 70 flight hours/month.<br data-end=\"7752\" data-start=\"7749\" />
Calculation: (2 Flight Crew + 5 Cabin Crew) x €83.50 = €584.50</p>

<p data-end=\"7925\" data-start=\"7818\">Average €584.50 x 1.1 =<strong> €642.95 per flight.</strong><br data-end=\"7864\" data-start=\"7861\" />
(1.1 = 01h05 average flight time from published schedules).</p>

<p data-end=\"7954\" data-start=\"7927\"><strong>g) Ground staff salaries:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"8089\" data-start=\"7956\">Salary based on €27,279 gross/year → €2,273 gross/month → €1,750 net/month (35h/week).<br data-end=\"8045\" data-start=\"8042\" />
Average for all ground staff at Air Inter.</p>

<p data-end=\"8306\" data-start=\"8091\">Average 10 people per aircraft → €162.40 gross/hour of actual work @ €16.24 gross/hour (140h/month) → <strong>€243.60 gross per flight</strong> (average 01h30 effective work per flight).<br data-end=\"8263\" data-start=\"8260\" />
Calculation: (10 x 16.24) x 1.5 = €243.60</p>

<p data-end=\"8322\" data-start=\"8308\"><strong>h) Catering:</strong></p>

<p data-end=\"8498\" data-start=\"8324\">Average 168 passengers + 5 cabin crew + 2 flight crew + 1 pilot (member) per flight = 176 PAX<br data-end=\"8420\" data-start=\"8417\" />
Catering rate: snack + meal = €13.50/person → 176 x 13.5 = <strong>€2,376 per flight</strong></p>

